annotation=54673R","line":36,"section":"page=34&annotation=54673R"},{"title":"p.34","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=34&annotation=54673R","line":39,"section":"page=34&annotation=54673R"},{"title":"现象可能有各式各样的掩蔽方式。有时现象还根本未经揭示，关于它谈不上认识也谈不上不认识。现象可能曾被揭示，但又沦入遮蔽状态。它可能被严丝合缝地遮蔽起来；但常规的情况是还看得见它， 然而却是作为假象才看得见。伪装是最经常最危险的遮蔽，因为它格外具有欺骗性，顽固地把我们引入歧途。然而，有多少假象，就有多少“存在”。","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=35&annotation=54682R","line":45,"section":"page=35&annotation=54682R"},{"title":"📖","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=35&annotation=54685R","line":49,"section":"page=35&annotation=54685R"},{"title":"📖","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=36&annotation=54688R","line":52,"section":"page=36&annotation=54688R"},{"title":"p.39","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=39&selection=19,7,32,19&color=yellow","line":56,"section":"page=39&selection=19,7,32,19&color=yellow"},{"title":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）, p.40","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=40&selection=83,7,95,21&color=note","line":69,"section":"page=40&selection=83,7,95,21&color=note"},{"title":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）, p.41","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=41&selection=6,3,10,13&color=red","line":72,"section":"page=41&selection=6,3,10,13&color=red"},{"title":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）, p.42","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=42&selection=13,6,25,17&color=important","line":75,"section":"page=42&selection=13,6,25,17&color=important"},{"title":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）, p.37","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=37&selection=8,0,65,15&color=red","line":78,"section":"page=37&selection=8,0,65,15&color=red"},{"title":"p.42","target":"用通俗方式解释复杂概念（全14册）.pdf#page=42&selection=43,4,63,20&color=yellow","line":81,"section":"page=42&selection=43,4,63,20&color=yellow"}],"blocks_data":{"#":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"178e486","at":1787848705795},"key":"未命名.md#","lines":[1,84],"size":4928,"should_embed":true,"embedding":{"history":[],"default":{"mf_ccarbz":{"file":"mf_ccarbz","file_i":3689,"read_hash":"178e486","at":1787848706952}}}}},"block_